==Battleground==
*4 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Nothing super complex about this stage, bring Critters for the Metal Hippoes. The I.M. Face has pretty good range, so a Critter with slightly longer range like [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]] will be more useful.

